"https://quarkus.io","size":451357,"stargazers_count":15335,"watchers_count":15335,"language":"Java","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":3033,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":2724,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cloud-native","hacktoberfest","java","kubernetes","reactive"],"visibility":"public","forks":3033,"open_issues":2724,"watchers":15335,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"## Describe the bug\r\nThe property `quarkus.swagger-ui.always-include` is a build time property, and so it should be possible to set `quarkus.swagger-ui.always-include=true` via Quarkus profiles, i.e. define it per profile in `application.properties`. When I try this and then successfully activate the profile at runtime, Quarkus still says \"RESTEASY003210: Could not find resource for full path: http://localhost:8080/q/swagger-ui/\".\r\n\r\n(I got encouraged by https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/7594#issuecomment-595212632 , )\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\nSwagger UI should be accessible when switched on via profile.\r\n\r\n### Actual behavior\r\n\"RESTEASY003210: Could not find resource for full path: http://localhost:8080/q/swagger-ui/\"\r\n\r\n\r\n## To Reproduce\r\n1. Download and unpack [swagger-ui.zip](https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/files/6352749/swagger-ui.zip)\r\n2. verify that reproducer contains swagger-ui by running `mvn compile quarkus:dev` and opening http://localhost:8080/q/swagger-ui/ \r\n2. `./mvnw package`\r\n3. `export QUARKUS_PROFILE=dev-environment`\r\n4. `java -jar target/quarkus-app/quarkus-run.jar`\r\n5. open http://localhost:8080/q/swagger-ui/ \r\n\r\nLink to a small reproducer (preferably a Maven project if the issue is not Gradle-specific).\r\n[swagger-ui.zip](https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/files/6352749/swagger-ui.zip)\r\n\r\n### Configuration\r\n```properties\r\nquarkus.swagger-ui.always-include=true\r\n%dev-environment.quarkus.swagger-ui.always-include=true\r\n%prod.quarkus.swagger-ui.always-include=false\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Output of `uname -a` or `ver`\r\nBoth on Mac and also reproducible in Docker image via quarkus-container-image-jib\r\n\r\n### Output of `java -version`\r\nopenjdk 14.0.2 2020-07-14\r\n\r\n### Quarkus version or git rev\r\n1.13.2.Final\r\n\r\n### Build tool (ie. output of `mvnw --version` or `gradlew --version`)\r\nApache Maven 3.6.3 (cecedd343002696d0abb50b32b541b8a6ba2883f)\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/16698/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/16698/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]